WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.990
Every cell division copies
billions of DNA bases.

2
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.510
Proofreading and repair
fix almost all errors.

3
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.220
The few that escape become permanent.

4
00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:14.860
Each person carries dozens of new
mutations that neither parent had.

5
00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.440
So when a living thing faces a new danger,

6
00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:20.120
can it mutate because it needs to?

7
00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:23.590
In this mission, you'll find
out where mutations come from,

8
00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.780
and what can make them more frequent.

9
00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:32.120
Then you'll see how a 1943 experiment put
this question to bacteria and a virus.

10
00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:36.850
Your mission: find out whether a living
thing can ever mutate because it needs

11
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:37.330
to.
